WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — from-ephemeral-inference-to-compiled-agency (zu) · microsoft-edge-neural

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:16.219
<v Narrator>Okuqala, ukudweba okuphezulu kwenziwa kube lula kuwo wonke umuntu lapho amamodeli e-neural abiza kakhulu esebenza njengendawo yokugcina ngemuva kwethebula lokusesha elisheshayo, izibalo zokusesha, kanye nezixazululi ezifanele.

2
00:00:16.299 --> 00:00:37.123
<v Narrator>Okulandelayo, ukucindezela isisindo ngaphansi kwe-bit eyodwa kugcina ubuhlakani, kodwa ukufaka emuva kumanani endawo yokushintshana ngesikhathi sokuqhuba kulahlekelwa amandla angaphezu kwamaphesenti ayishumi nesishiyagalombili ngaphezulu kwebhodi lemoto kunesikhathi sokusebenza ngokuqondile.

3
00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:54.090
<v Narrator>Yesibili, i-integer kernel eyodwa ehlolwe nge-cryptographic hashes ikhiqiza impendulo efanayo phakathi kwamaprosesa, amakhadi wezithombe, WebAssembly, umbono wehardware, nama-microcontrollers, ukuyeka ngokushesha uma ubunzima obuhlukile.
